  "description_short": "Premium steakhouse on Marsh Street serving aged beef and classic grills in a warm, welcoming atmosphere.",
  "description_long": "The Hussar Grill brings its renowned steakhouse tradition to Mossel Bay's historic town centre on Marsh Street. Known for perfectly aged beef and expertly grilled cuts, this local branch maintains the brand's reputation for quality without the pretension. The menu focuses on premium steaks, from fillet to ribeye, alongside classic sides and a solid wine selection.\n\nThe atmosphere strikes a balance between upmarket and accessible — polished wooden tables, attentive service, and that distinctive grill-smoke aroma as you walk in. It's equally suited to a business dinner or a family celebration. The setting is traditional steakhouse through and through, with comfortable seating and a menu that doesn't try to reinvent the wheel.\n\nLocated in the heart of Mossel Bay, it's an easy walk from the harbour and makes for a reliable choice after a day exploring the coast. Bookings are recommended, especially on weekends when locals and visitors fill the tables for their signature cuts and generous portions.",
